    "Avoid overreacting to short-term volatility; use 18-day history as anchor for smoothing.",
    "If true outcome consistently lags forecast by 1-3 days, shift forecast horizon slightly backward to align with observed lag.",
    "When sentiment is flat or mildly negative, reduce forecast variance to avoid overconfidence in upward moves."
